          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006a.C.dialog-act.vkaraisk.82",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006a",
          "text": "So I had to uh , <vocalsound> I dunno , make an overview for myself about what I have to do ,",
